*
!openbinding-gateway/
!openbinding-gateway/**
# The gateway image installs bim-core and bim-client (metadata and sources) and nothing else of
# the toolchain: not bim-service, not the tests, not the corpus. openbinding-gateway/Dockerfile
# COPYs exactly these paths; tests/test_docker_context.py keeps both in step. hatch_build.py is the
# build hook of bim-core and the verified download of its five OMG XSDs, which Git does not version
# (tests/test_omg_xsd_wiring.py).
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-core/pyproject.toml
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-core/hatch_build.py
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-core/README.md
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-core/NOTICE.md
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-core/src
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-client/pyproject.toml
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-client/README.md
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-client/NOTICE.md
!bim-toolchain/packages/bim-client/src
!schemas/
!schemas/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!experimentation/
!experimentation/qacobench/
!experimentation/qacobench/**
!datasets/
!datasets/scripts/
!datasets/scripts/transform_*.py
!datasets/scripts/write_benchmark_metadata.py

**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
experimentation/qacobench/paper/
